      "statement": "VOLY separates text/model inference from file-capable execution: `Pipeline.run()` routes and runs inference through an `InferenceManager` configured with the shared gateway, while `AgentRunner.run()` invokes an executor against an explicit `cwd`, captures repository changes, and applies executor safety policy.",
